<h1>Points &amp; Miles Valuations Directory</h1>
<p class="sub">Stop guessing what your points are worth. We track industry-standard valuations, baseline redemption floors, and official partner policy changes so you can make math-backed award decisions.</p>

<div class="callout" style="margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
  <strong>How to Use These Baselines:</strong> Loyalty points carry no statutory cash value. Use our baseline estimates to benchmark your redemptions. To calculate the total cash worth of your portfolio, use our <a href="/en/calculators/points-to-dollars/" style="color: var(--gold); text-decoration: underline;">Miles to Dollars Calculator</a>, or verify specific award tickets with our <a href="/en/calculators/cents-per-point/" style="color: var(--gold); text-decoration: underline;">CPP Calculator</a>.
</div>

